   "key_scope": "mark",
   "caption": "Average Real Producer Price Index by Record Period, shown to answer track the trajectory and shocks in the real agricultural producer price index over time. The Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO) Statistics Division compiled country-level agricultural producer prices deflated by consumer price indices alongside gross per-capita agricultural output from 2005 to 2023. The dataset evaluates terms of trade shocks, commodity-specific volatility, and structural agricultural output differences across global income classifications.",
